{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cd3cdc71c8187eaa8e1db9889db225c4e3a4ec2f6d1c0e8c41059fa7ceb8a6c8", "ja": "（作曲家さんに依頼していた、新曲のデモが届いた。\nさて、翼はどこにいるかな……）", "zh": "（拜托作曲家创作的新歌小样送来了。\n那么，翼在哪里呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "8cbc92bed1b67dc1d5d744b22fae194635efb20b0ae9a30da161529ca1692ccf", "ja": "楽しいことかぁ……\nだったら、キャッチボールしようぜ♪", "zh": "开心的事啊……\n那就来玩传接球吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "737530368874f0d340e24564ee75fac1296654b4ec18f06a70e4040f5ecfdf1f", "ja": "え～？　昴くん、\nキャッチボールなら、昨日もやったよ～？", "zh": "诶～？昴君，昨天不是也玩过传接球了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "a4f21107cd8a64d5c0471c2b2a69532498fd61e1732e2797aad2a79426f8baeb", "ja": "え？　でもキャッチボールって、\n毎日やったって楽しいだろ？　なぁ、紬！", "zh": "诶？但接球游戏每天玩也很开心吧？对吧，紬！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9af452ec58a27a849bbd408adde0b31fa7dfb50d29a77002ee4b6afd8ce65bef", "ja": "え！　う、うち？　あの……\n毎日キャッチボールは、したことがないので……。", "zh": "诶！我、我吗？那个……\n我没试过每天都玩传接球……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1005_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1006_p", "source_sha256": "97c9b815d770588c24d4794222982b7b486f4045485cb8e424bb2d746119e739", "ja": "翼……昴、紬もここだったのか。\nみんな、何の話をしてたんだ？", "zh": "翼……昴、紬，你们也在这里啊。大家刚才在聊什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "4ec87cd3399325962bedb4a16b1c4a019b8890ba205e4d86adf55dacd3846ac2", "ja": "お疲れ、{$P$}！\n何って、えーっと……キャッチボールの話だよ！", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}！\n什么话题？呃……是在说传接球啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6f017fa9583a194e5f54ed65bd9ad84645f65c79de3d95bcae0058a6b03887a1", "ja": "あの、永吉さん。私たちはそもそも、\n先日のライブの感想を話していたかと……。", "zh": "那个，永吉同学。我们原本\n应该是在聊前几天那场演出的感想吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ced89488206f87dcd1c4cb645eaf67b023b012c8aa0bd8cc4d4488945826aa63", "ja": "いつ大きなステージに立つことになってもいいように、\nもっと練習をしないと……と考えていたところです。", "zh": "我正在想……为了能在无论何时登上大舞台都能做好准备，\n必须得更加努力练习才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1010_p", "source_sha256": "bb185f3c7c91b4110f4f990b699a611132ccbf5dfaf0a01b139e209f9b9af4af", "ja": "そうか。みんな、やる気十分だな！\nなら、レッスンがちょっとくらい増えても大丈夫か？", "zh": "这样啊。大家都干劲十足嘛！  \n那就算稍微增加一点课程，也没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "827f355b021a7a5c1895efc0dfca6e92fc71aba4887d73ece22053a088fcc434", "ja": "えーっ！　そんなことしたら、レッスンがつまんなく\nなっちゃう。今だって、けっこう大変なんですよ～？", "zh": "欸——！要是那样的话，训练就会变得很无聊的。现在的训练已经够辛苦了～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "43c301b22630d72c09c1d2b6938613e9104eb2740750c79d2cebf7bb66bd1675", "ja": "そうだ、{$P$}さん！\nお仕事はもう終わりですか？", "zh": "对了，{$P$}先生！工作已经结束了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6b14641dfea9b540e7d4c76c6d3ac968174f742246d3e51dc18848c2fe5e9bc8", "ja": "今からわたしと遊びに行きませんか？　ステキなお店、\n見つけたんですよ～。楽しいことしましょ～！", "zh": "现在要不要和我一起出去玩？我发现了一家很棒的店哦～一起去做些开心的事吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1014_p", "source_sha256": "3088365bfe0e7b88d9dfe5d41c4ee9913de7b08e8462cc6c8d48310d9cb7ab85", "ja": "楽しいこと？\nそれなら、翼にとっておきの話があるぞ！", "zh": "开心的事？\n那我有件特别的事要告诉翼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "93b81fbf8d4abf143669c9832ddd717cf443ca744ec2ad408b0aba10bfd71639", "ja": "えっ、なになに！？\n{$P$}さん、教えて～！", "zh": "咦，是什么是什么！？\n{$P$}先生，告诉我嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1016_p", "source_sha256": "0bcbadb4cf2ece1090d70e53eb8931cf2ae47fe06d149f0ae8410fb11bf34c15", "ja": "翼の新曲が届いたんだ。\n歌詞はまだ仮だけど……ほら。", "zh": "翼的新歌送来了。歌词还只是暂定的……你看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7b13f648bc5eb84376621884631cccb4f2034b0f1039c0e7031d57b0ffebb2e8", "ja": "えっ？　新曲って……わたしの新曲？\nほんとですか！？", "zh": "诶？新曲……是我的新曲？\n真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8c0527a6b0ec55292602f24d2d104bd1442c2691563bdc668b628cfe62632976", "ja": "わぁ……新しい曲、もらえるんだ……。\nえへへ、うれしいな～。", "zh": "哇……要有新歌了呀……\n诶嘿嘿，好开心～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "787edb90be5a56cf387048641b337009297c8a05ec31fb2b8b953cec8bc1c55e", "ja": "あっ！　もしかして、そのせいでレッスンが増えるの？\nう～、レッスンしなくていい新曲ならいいのに～。", "zh": "啊！难道说，因为这个，练习也要增加了吗？\n呜～要是有不用练习的新歌就好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1020_p", "source_sha256": "302b9a2da94f683a091161025dfefb67d74ac73b7207a74b5675e6acfa4843ee", "ja": "そう言われてもな……。\nレコーディングもあるし、公演でだって披露するし。", "zh": "就算你这么说……录音也需要练习，而且还要在公演上演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1021_p", "source_sha256": "ab28c05663adaf79f13fc849ecbaad2e0591452c4436384c4aead4de94f5bc38", "ja": "だから、ちゃんとレッスンする事！", "zh": "所以，要好好练习！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7cb0a43b5d3e68ca920667d85e7a54a6db028bf8efeca342e924460f75d20c11", "ja": "え～！\nレッスンばっかりとか、そんなのつまんない～！", "zh": "诶～！\n光是一直练习什么的，那也太无聊了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "970604177851c6e6e6464b304c55ea586bce8da6306e4346ba7daaaf0795a245", "ja": "あ、そうだ！　{$P$}さ～ん！\nレッスンがんばるから、先にごほうびくださ～い！", "zh": "啊，对了！{$P$}先生——！\n我会努力练习的，所以先给我奖励嘛——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1024_p", "source_sha256": "12f94a91a78478374ef1685807bcabc961d39a2535050f6aca32f0861e11af11", "ja": "まだ始めてもいないのに……仕方がないな。\nそれで、何をご褒美にもらえたら、翼は頑張れるんだ？", "zh": "都还没开始呢……真拿你没办法。\n那么，翼要拿到什么奖励才肯努力呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "fd8a88fc91817af51e2bc492db651309d1c75b736fad87f6690b51c273a9450f", "ja": "もちろん、{$P$}さんとデート！\nですよ～。えへへっ、よろしくお願いしま～す！", "zh": "当然是和{$P$}先生约会啦～就是这样哦～嘿嘿，请多关照啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1026_047sub", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1027_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1028_p", "source_sha256": "945f1707e143337fbdbb1e123c2f611b2b6267cbaab1800f5164ebe3266977d6", "ja": "わかったわかった。それで翼が\nちゃんと頑張るっていうなら、考えておくよ。", "zh": "好好好，我知道了。要是翼保证会\n好好努力的话，我就考虑一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1029_047sub", "source_sha256": "91410b9479cd13f83f2c5400a1ea3ad4a834f290261a8d9c905cf5276887414e", "ja": "すっげー……！　デートだって！　デートって\nアレだよな？　ふたりで水族館に行ったりするんだろ！", "zh": "太棒了……！约会！约会就是那个吧？两个人一起去水族馆之类的，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1030_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ace44935cd95486604de593a61035ef8cfb2bacf8c401624960581faf58e57d8", "ja": "あなたという人は……まさか本気で伊吹さんと、\nこ、個人的な、仲を深めようと……？", "zh": "你这个人真是的……难不成是当真想和伊吹同学，\n加、加深私底下的关系……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1031_p", "source_sha256": "4870858b8f41687a70ff84c96dbc23ce954c281acabb57318f2d380dff3f0a7f", "ja": "え？　……あ、いや、昴とは前にも勉強のために、\nデートしたよな？　あれと似たようなもので……。", "zh": "咦？……啊，不是，我以前也和昴为了学习约过会吧？和那差不多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1032_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6e588569caf6df1e0a490725709a407aeff9ba896d876ec179739fc1597ab6fd", "ja": "えーっ！　ダメですよ、{$P$}さん！\n勉強じゃなくて、ちゃんとしたデートがいい～！", "zh": "诶——！不行啦，{$P$}先生！不要学习，要正儿八经地约会才行～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1033_016tsu", "source_sha256": "fb313d4a052391de96b8412f77830391fda24db99fdc7c41797d9605f3074f4d", "ja": "ちゃんとデートしてくれないと、\nわたし、がんばれないかも……。", "zh": "要是不好好陪我约会，我可能就没法努力了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1034_p", "source_sha256": "8cadcb7c4e2d6912d065aaecaf0958cdf18c2c85bcce293f032bc779ae983c42", "ja": "わかったわかった。ちゃんとデートするよ。\n……翼にレッスンしてもらうために！", "zh": "知道了知道了。我会好好跟你约会的。\n……为了让翼好好去练习！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1035_p", "source_sha256": "4a2df9cb173abb3c923e0781cfd5f90d7f238fb57e00e2b20c0ba180045fb30d", "ja": "というわけで翼も、ちゃんとレッスンに出るんだぞ？", "zh": "所以说，翼也要好好参加训练，知道了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1036_016tsu", "source_sha256": "92cabe2e8451111c71dea0ee6df0536c30f08e715a57ca5fa602c795c41e4b04", "ja": "はーい、わかりました！\nレッスン、がんばりま～す！", "zh": "好——，明白了！\n我会努力参加训练的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1037_p", "source_sha256": "9d9aa18c689d0313a7a8494d665a453e9b008ee8811c1c1551b49306a32f6e8f", "ja": "公演には、昴と紬にも出てもらおうと思ってる。\nふたりとも、よろしく頼む！", "zh": "我打算让昴和紬也参加演出。\n两位，就拜托你们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1038_047sub", "source_sha256": "18f5c852d3db6088a4ad1484d2671ce468a8bda4916dcfaf0c2b926bfd3dce12", "ja": "あ、そうなんだ？\nへへっ、わかったよ！　まかせてくれよな♪", "zh": "啊，原来是这样？\n嘿嘿，知道啦！交给我吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1039_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b5a87d3239ca5bfa266a00ce116811e5d703a8644562bfeea2c20a47eba54974", "ja": "……はい、それはそれで。\n自分の使命を、果たしてみせます。", "zh": "……好的，那归那。\n我定会完成自己的使命。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1040_047sub", "source_sha256": "f88661f9b7b9a778100f86bd424751a716ad11015dd92157344790bcfd022f32", "ja": "なぁなぁ、翼！　デートでどんなことしたか、\nあとでオレたちにも教えてくれよな！", "zh": "喂喂，翼！约会时都做了些什么，之后也告诉我们呗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1041_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5c4598e52736e0b12cc66dcc18b53eb9bc5ea04d337cb4aba7bd3ada1ebf97da", "ja": "お願いしますね、伊吹さん。\nその、なにかと心配ですし……。なにかと。", "zh": "拜托你了，伊吹。\n那个，我总觉得有点担心……各种方面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_056_1042_p", "source_sha256": "654f80511c1feabe9dd04d1236dfd68caf2462ce7dc7cbe56772cc37ade66dc7", "ja": "（とりあえず、翼がやる気を出してくれてよかった！\nあとは公演まで続くかどうか……本人を信じてみよう）", "zh": "（总之，翼能打起精神来真是太好了！接下来就看她能不能坚持到公演了……还是相信她一次吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
